WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:03.280 --> 00:00:06.400
One of the fastest growing&nbsp;
areas here in Waimakariri&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:06.400 --> 00:00:11.280
is the northeast, with Woodend,&nbsp;
Ravenswood and of course Pegasus.

00:00:14.160 --> 00:00:21.120
We currently rent space here in Pegasus for&nbsp;
community activities, but really, it's too small.

00:00:21.120 --> 00:00:27.440
So the Council is proposing to buy land and&nbsp;
build new community centres for these areas.

00:00:28.560 --> 00:00:34.080
The Council's preferred option is to buy land and&nbsp;
build a community centre in Pegasus starting next&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:34.080 --> 00:00:40.560
year, then around 2028 buy land in Ravenswood&nbsp;
and build another community facility there.

00:00:41.440 --> 00:00:45.200
Alternatively we could build both facilities&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:45.200 --> 00:00:52.720
within the next five years or we could build&nbsp;
one large centre to cater for all areas&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:52.720 --> 00:00:58.080
including woodend and that could be&nbsp;
either here at Ravenswood or at Pegasus.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:11.840
Visit waimakariri.govt.nz/letstalk to&nbsp;
look at the options and to have your say.

